Z||000006||FieroSTETZ||11-21-2001||01:51 AM||||behold my sig, the anigif of all anigifs... haha... <BR>what i did was go to <A HREF="http://www.jasc.com," TARGET=_blank>www.jasc.com,</A>  and dpwnloaded paint shop pro with animation shop- like psp a lot better than photoshop, not as great a program, but so much faster and to the point for quick jobs- thats what i used for my sig.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.shawnrocks.com/Animation1.gif"> ||||reg||1
